<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.residue.lands ~ residue ~ a handback keyed idempotently

`lares spirit residue <pet>` lands a report (`--file <path|->` or `--text <words>`) as residue under the pet's own name, keyed by `--key <session:agent>` so the same report lands once. `--witness` reads every landed handback (and `--transcripts <dir|file>`) for the frame and the Personas: one receipt line each, one tally, exit 0.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ land · witness

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`land` params=`pet/lares-alpha key/s1:a1 file/report.md ~ land one report`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`witness` params=`pet/lares-alpha witness/true ~ read every landed handback for the frame`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · pet · file · text · key · witness · transcripts

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pet` params=`takes/pet-name needs/required seat/1 as/<pet> ~ the spirit's pet name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path ~ the report from a host file, or - for stdin`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`text` params=`takes/words ~ the report as words`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`key` params=`takes/key ~ the idempotency key, session:agent`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`witness` params=`~ read the landed handbacks instead of landing one`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`transcripts` params=`takes/host-path ~ beside witness, a transcript dir or file to read too`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/write-on-the-daemon-wiki ~ the residue lands through the tiddler door's put`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · spirit-pet-malformed · spirit-secret-shaped · spirit-write-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.residue.lands pet/lares-alpha file/-]] ~ no words or two sources`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-pet-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.residue.lands pet/lares-alpha file/-]] ~ the word reads as no pet name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-secret-shaped` params=`~ the words hold secret-shaped strings`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-write-refused` params=`~ the tiddler door answered no put`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed · witnessed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[pet title hash landed cut]] ~ landed reads put, or exists where the key already stands`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`witnessed` params=`exit/0 ~ one receipt line per handback and one tally`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

